<h2 class="mt-14">Consent and purchaser suppression for Browse abandonment</h2>
<p>Before any browse abandonment automation goes live, confirm that every app in the stack records email and SMS consent in a form you can audit, and that purchase events suppress promotional follow-up immediately after checkout. A message that lands after a purchase, a refund, or an unresolved support case damages the channel faster than weak creative ever will.</p>
